      "side": 1,
      "message": "Translating a preview API level to 10000 is often useful, which would make FinalApiLevel and PreviewApiLevel interfaces identical, and maybe you could then just have an ApiLevel struct instead?",
      "revId": "eceaa0242ca5e36a9e0309017d89444a5c38e4da",
