      "writtenOn": "2020-08-13T21:03:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This has come up before, and I\u0027ve always pushed back because this doesn\u0027t match the behavior of the \"R\" constant in an AndroidManifest.xml, where \"R\" specifically means targeting a preview SDK, and must be replaced with \"30\" to target the final SDK.",
      "parentUuid": "941d8943_a459d867",
      "range": {
